WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:01:24.800 --> 00:01:27.120
Looks like she's not coming this year.

00:01:27.680 --> 00:01:28.920
She comes every year.

00:01:31.800 --> 00:01:33.760
I'll go get two bowls of soup.

00:01:35.040 --> 00:01:38.400
Two of the chef's special.
Tell me what you think!

00:01:39.440 --> 00:01:44.120
She might be blind,
but her soups are a real treat!

00:01:45.640 --> 00:01:47.120
Where'd he go?

00:01:52.240 --> 00:01:54.560
He's alive! He is alive!

00:01:57.840 --> 00:01:59.440
What happened to me?

00:01:59.520 --> 00:02:02.160
You had some trouble
coming out of the tube.

00:02:16.640 --> 00:02:20.600
Right. We all just fought that man,
with his collection of panties.

00:02:21.640 --> 00:02:24.000
-Where's Yugo?
-Not here yet.

00:02:24.560 --> 00:02:27.680
He got into a fight
with Princess Pain-in-the-Patoot.

00:02:27.760 --> 00:02:29.560
I heard that, Elely!

00:02:31.120 --> 00:02:34.360
He's the pain in the butt
and he's a selfish little pig!

00:02:34.920 --> 00:02:39.040
-Are you talking about our Yugo?
-Do you know any others?

00:02:39.720 --> 00:02:42.200
What did he do to get you this worked up?

00:02:42.760 --> 00:02:44.160
None of your business!

00:02:49.400 --> 00:02:51.200
Not the easiest way to travel.

00:02:51.280 --> 00:02:53.640
-You guys make it okay?
-Of course!

00:02:59.840 --> 00:03:03.400
-Amalia, can we talk about--
-No, Yugo. We cannot.

00:03:04.440 --> 00:03:05.320
Okay.

00:03:07.880 --> 00:03:10.800
Have you had any time
to check out this place yet?

00:03:11.760 --> 00:03:14.680
So, that's it, then?
You've moved on that quickly?

00:03:14.760 --> 00:03:18.520
But I just asked if you wanted
to talk and you didn't want to!

00:03:18.600 --> 00:03:21.080
I've never seen you give up so quickly.

00:03:21.800 --> 00:03:23.720
So, you do want to talk, then?

00:03:24.320 --> 00:03:26.720
I did want to, but not so much now.

00:03:27.280 --> 00:03:29.240
But you just said that you...

00:03:30.440 --> 00:03:32.880
You don't even know what you want!

00:03:33.840 --> 00:03:36.240
I don't know what I want, really!

00:03:36.320 --> 00:03:38.880
Stop!

00:03:41.440 --> 00:03:43.440
Will you two stop acting like kids?

00:03:43.520 --> 00:03:46.680
The only one with a reason
to complain here is Elely.

00:03:46.760 --> 00:03:50.320
The poor girl lost her whole family
and we may not find them.

00:03:50.400 --> 00:03:52.440
So, your stupid lovers' quarrel...

00:03:54.520 --> 00:03:56.280
We are going to find them!

00:03:56.360 --> 00:03:59.520
Out of the three,
one or two must have made it.

00:03:59.600 --> 00:04:03.040
Papa... He said he was going
to catch up with us soon.

00:04:03.960 --> 00:04:06.680
And now... he still hasn't made it here.

00:04:06.760 --> 00:04:09.520
I just know something bad
has happened to him.

00:04:10.800 --> 00:04:13.640
You'll see.
This isn't your father's first rodeo.

00:04:13.720 --> 00:04:16.920
That man keeps dying
and he always comes back to life.

00:04:17.000 --> 00:04:20.560
Don't worry about Eva and Flopin.
We'll find them, I promise.

00:04:22.440 --> 00:04:24.520
So, there's no time left to lose!

00:04:24.600 --> 00:04:27.080
Do these tiles on the floor look familiar?

00:04:27.160 --> 00:04:29.680
They look the same as in your house.

00:04:30.840 --> 00:04:35.360
You're right. So, we must have reached
the temple of the demigod Enutrof.

00:04:36.040 --> 00:04:38.320
I wonder what he looks like.

00:04:42.840 --> 00:04:45.640
It seems to have musical protection.

00:04:45.720 --> 00:04:47.960
Much more complex than I've ever seen.

00:04:48.040 --> 00:04:51.240
But if anyone is the right man
for the job, it's Ruru.

00:04:53.040 --> 00:04:56.480
Yeah, well, it would be nice
if Ruru would hurry it up,

00:04:56.560 --> 00:04:59.200
instead of making little girls cry.

00:05:06.520 --> 00:05:09.280
There, my makeshift rope
should hold up now, Mama.

00:05:09.360 --> 00:05:11.920
You impress me more each day, my love.

00:05:12.680 --> 00:05:14.400
You're becoming so clever.

00:05:14.480 --> 00:05:17.840
I've got a secret for you, Mama.
I don't get it from Papa!

00:05:19.600 --> 00:05:22.440
Sweet-talker,
but that's not nice about your dad.

00:05:22.520 --> 00:05:24.880
Careful. We don't know what's down there.

00:05:24.960 --> 00:05:29.080
This might be our only chance
to get out of here, so we got to do this.

00:05:38.440 --> 00:05:39.440
Flo?

00:05:43.680 --> 00:05:44.520
Flo?

00:05:47.360 --> 00:05:48.360
I'm okay!

00:05:49.040 --> 00:05:52.520
You can come down.
It looks like we made it home, Mama.

00:06:05.680 --> 00:06:09.520
My special homemade powder is able
to show us which of these tiles

00:06:09.600 --> 00:06:12.400
are used to open the door.

00:06:12.480 --> 00:06:15.640
Now I just have to test
all the possible combinations.

00:06:16.200 --> 00:06:17.320
How long?

00:06:45.400 --> 00:06:48.640
All right, then,
this is going to take forever.

00:07:07.360 --> 00:07:10.440
The two of you are seriously pathetic.

00:07:27.640 --> 00:07:29.680
Ruel, did you figure it out?

00:07:30.280 --> 00:07:32.640
Huh? Yes. No. Maybe...

00:07:32.720 --> 00:07:35.720
What do you mean?
Did you do figure it out or not?

00:07:59.280 --> 00:08:00.560
Please.

00:08:00.640 --> 00:08:03.160
Oh, thank you, sir.

00:08:04.640 --> 00:08:07.160
Thank you, kind lady.

00:08:17.680 --> 00:08:20.160
Oh, thank you.

00:08:23.720 --> 00:08:27.400
Watch it, fleabag!
That coin's mine! It's mine!

00:08:30.720 --> 00:08:33.840
-I wasn't trying to steal it.
-You're still a fleabag!

00:08:34.480 --> 00:08:35.920
Take a look at yourself!

00:08:49.360 --> 00:08:50.320
Fleabag!

00:09:06.080 --> 00:09:08.640
Awesome! You see, Amalia?

00:09:08.720 --> 00:09:12.920
You always say that Ruel is useless,
but he's come through for us twice.

00:09:13.840 --> 00:09:17.680
He does have a real talent
for breaking into strangers' homes.

00:09:18.680 --> 00:09:19.960
-You okay, Ruel?
-Huh?

00:09:20.040 --> 00:09:23.920
Yeah. It's just that tune
brought back some old memories.

00:09:25.560 --> 00:09:28.240
Well, in any case, you did it once again.

00:09:28.320 --> 00:09:31.520
Of course I did.
"Did it" is my middle name!

00:09:46.240 --> 00:09:48.760
So now it's a labyrinth.
That's just great!

00:09:51.520 --> 00:09:53.800
-It's a trap.
-How do you know?

00:09:53.880 --> 00:09:56.000
I'm absolutely sure it's a trap.

00:09:56.080 --> 00:09:58.200
Papa taught me to trust my instincts.

00:09:58.280 --> 00:10:03.000
There are four doors and four of us.
It's not a coincidence, so it's a trap.

00:10:03.080 --> 00:10:07.000
Iops don't have the most reliable
instincts, but I see your point.

00:10:08.240 --> 00:10:12.440
It would be worse to think they knew
there'd only be four of us now.

00:10:17.560 --> 00:10:19.240
No, that's not possible.

00:10:19.800 --> 00:10:22.600
In any case, they want to separate us.

00:10:22.680 --> 00:10:24.480
But we can easily beat them.

00:10:27.560 --> 00:10:30.600
With this magic thread,
we'll stay connected.

00:10:30.680 --> 00:10:32.080
We'll each take a door.

00:10:32.160 --> 00:10:35.400
The first one to find the exit
tugs on the thread twice.

00:10:36.800 --> 00:10:38.800
The others can follow the thread.

00:10:44.880 --> 00:10:46.440
That's a great idea!

00:10:47.440 --> 00:10:50.080
You're getting a little bit too familiar.

00:10:50.160 --> 00:10:53.400
I'm impressed, Amalia.
You'd make an excellent Enutrof.

00:10:53.480 --> 00:10:55.120
I'd rather die, Ruru.

00:10:55.200 --> 00:10:57.040
Amalia, you are...

00:10:57.840 --> 00:10:59.360
Impressive?

00:10:59.440 --> 00:11:01.400
Yeah. You impress me, Amalia.

00:11:01.480 --> 00:11:04.000
A good start
if you want me to forgive you.

00:11:04.080 --> 00:11:08.120
-Okay, let's go!
-Yes, let's get going!

00:11:08.200 --> 00:11:09.680
A hallway each.

00:11:55.680 --> 00:11:57.600
You think I'm scared!

00:12:03.520 --> 00:12:05.240
Where are you going?

00:12:42.600 --> 00:12:44.600
All right, that was pretty easy.

00:12:52.360 --> 00:12:53.720
I should have known.

00:13:13.000 --> 00:13:15.440
Yuk! That smells horrible!

00:13:15.520 --> 00:13:18.320
Luckily, I'm used to Flopin's farts.

00:13:30.120 --> 00:13:32.160
Thank you! By the way...

00:13:44.240 --> 00:13:45.200
Yeah, nice try.

00:14:07.400 --> 00:14:10.360
Hey, buddy, your days of freedom
are almost over.

00:14:11.680 --> 00:14:16.720
Risdo the Compulsive Chopper,
that's a pretty big catch, for a fleabag!

00:14:17.280 --> 00:14:18.480
No begging today?

00:14:19.040 --> 00:14:22.880
Never more than once a week,
or people get used to your misery.

00:14:22.960 --> 00:14:25.920
The Chopper is a madman.
You won't get him alone.

00:14:26.000 --> 00:14:27.800
But I know where he's hiding.

00:14:28.360 --> 00:14:30.360
He's still going to kill you.

00:14:30.440 --> 00:14:33.360
He's a ferocious beast
who lives to chop things up.

00:14:33.440 --> 00:14:35.680
You're going to need help.

00:14:35.760 --> 00:14:39.120
Why don't we catch him together
and split the bounty?

00:14:39.200 --> 00:14:41.520
But I have vital information.

00:14:42.320 --> 00:14:44.240
-I'll give you 30%.
-40%.

00:14:44.960 --> 00:14:45.880
35.

00:14:48.640 --> 00:14:49.840
Deal!

00:15:51.880 --> 00:15:54.160
I just have to tell the others.

00:16:08.760 --> 00:16:12.360
I found it near a cemetery.
I hope you like it.

00:16:13.360 --> 00:16:16.440
I don't care about the ring, Ruel.
I just want you.

00:16:20.480 --> 00:16:23.520
-Let's have a honeymoon.
-You're paying for it.

00:16:24.440 --> 00:16:25.440
40%.

00:16:58.880 --> 00:17:02.960
Since we've been together,
my savings are drying up so fast.

00:17:03.040 --> 00:17:06.960
So are mine, Ruel.
I love you, but I feel bad.

00:17:07.040 --> 00:17:10.480
With you, I want to enjoy life,
so I spend all my money.

00:17:10.560 --> 00:17:11.880
I feel so guilty.

00:17:11.960 --> 00:17:14.800
If we continue on like this,
we'll end up broke.

00:17:14.880 --> 00:17:17.400
But I have an idea that might fix things.

00:17:17.960 --> 00:17:19.320
Let's take a break.

00:17:19.880 --> 00:17:23.720
Just a few years to save up enough
so we'll never have to worry.

00:17:26.720 --> 00:17:30.320
We can meet back here every year
for a bowl of soup.

00:17:30.400 --> 00:17:32.760
Fortune awaits, my darling!

00:17:59.080 --> 00:18:00.920
Arpa... Arpagone.

00:18:02.120 --> 00:18:03.920
Hello, Mr. Stroud!

00:18:06.960 --> 00:18:08.800
How is my husband doing?

00:18:09.480 --> 00:18:11.280
What are you doing here?

00:18:19.920 --> 00:18:22.680
You... never came back for me.

00:18:25.760 --> 00:18:28.400
Do you remember the last time
we saw each other?

00:18:37.920 --> 00:18:39.760
Guess who!

00:18:39.840 --> 00:18:43.760
A charming voice, soft hands,
I'd say the most beautiful of women!

00:18:44.720 --> 00:18:45.920
What a charmer!

00:18:48.440 --> 00:18:50.760
I've ordered. You're paying this year.

00:18:52.680 --> 00:18:55.840
Ruel... I don't have a single Kama.

00:18:55.920 --> 00:18:58.320
-What?
-My fortune is in your hands.

00:18:58.400 --> 00:19:00.440
I can't stand being away from you.

00:19:01.000 --> 00:19:04.640
I love you more
than all the gold in the world.

00:19:04.720 --> 00:19:06.480
I choose you, Ruel!

00:19:06.560 --> 00:19:08.040
But I don't understand.

00:19:08.120 --> 00:19:09.960
There's nothing to understand.

00:19:10.040 --> 00:19:13.960
If you love me, you'll have to choose
as well. Me or your fortune?

00:19:14.520 --> 00:19:17.960
I'm going to need time
to think about this.

00:19:18.520 --> 00:19:21.240
-Listen, I... need to go.
-No!

00:19:32.640 --> 00:19:35.600
You chose your fortune over your wife.

00:19:36.440 --> 00:19:38.200
And what about now?

00:19:38.880 --> 00:19:40.160
You're getting old.

00:19:41.520 --> 00:19:43.360
Ready to keep your promise?

00:20:05.200 --> 00:20:06.840
Ruel! Finally!

00:20:08.480 --> 00:20:11.920
Hey... Yugo, why the long face?

00:20:12.000 --> 00:20:13.600
Is something bothering you?

00:20:16.360 --> 00:20:18.600
I've been thinking about Adamai.

00:20:18.680 --> 00:20:23.040
I really want to see him, but I'm also
scared of what he's become.

00:20:24.600 --> 00:20:26.880
-And with Amalia?
-Huh?

00:20:26.960 --> 00:20:29.640
That... It's really complicated.

00:20:30.840 --> 00:20:33.680
There's nothing complicated about love.

00:20:33.760 --> 00:20:38.960
I'm not sure if what I feel is love.
I've known Amalia for years.

00:20:39.040 --> 00:20:43.080
So, you'd think my biggest problem
is still being a child, but it's not.

00:20:44.000 --> 00:20:49.160
I don't feel ready for anything. I feel
like I'm going to live for an eternity.

00:20:49.240 --> 00:20:51.800
The only one who can understand is Adamai.

00:20:51.880 --> 00:20:53.640
Have you told to Amalia?

00:20:53.720 --> 00:20:58.920
Yes and no. I tried to, but I can't ever
seem to get a word in with that princess.

00:20:59.000 --> 00:21:02.320
She's so self-absorbed,
she can't see people's distress.

00:21:07.800 --> 00:21:09.480
He's got some nerve!

00:21:11.560 --> 00:21:13.160
Amalia!

00:21:14.920 --> 00:21:15.920
You're crying?

00:21:17.120 --> 00:21:20.680
No. It's just some dust in my eye.
Let's go join the others!

00:21:23.920 --> 00:21:25.880
It was pretty easy here, right?

00:21:26.800 --> 00:21:28.920
Easy as pie, thanks to Amalia.

00:21:29.920 --> 00:21:33.720
Sure. Let's move on to whatever's next.
I want to get this over with.

00:21:34.280 --> 00:21:36.160
That's what I want to hear!

00:21:44.720 --> 00:21:49.000
-Is everything going according to plan?
-As expected, Oropo!

00:21:49.080 --> 00:21:53.040
I've got my husband back
and your chameleon has taken his place.

00:21:53.120 --> 00:21:54.280
Perfect!

00:21:54.360 --> 00:21:57.240
Ruel, it's good to see you again,
my friend.

00:21:57.320 --> 00:21:59.720
Don't think you're being punished.

00:21:59.800 --> 00:22:02.960
This is my way of thanking you...
for everything.

00:22:03.040 --> 00:22:05.720
I'm going to make you into a god!

00:22:07.600 --> 00:22:09.040
Think about it, Ruel.

00:22:09.600 --> 00:22:12.160
If you take the place of the god Enutrof,

00:22:12.240 --> 00:22:14.040
eternity will be finally ours,

00:22:14.120 --> 00:22:16.880
eternity
and all of the treasure in the world.

00:22:16.960 --> 00:22:21.520
You and I will be the wealthiest
and happiest couple in the Krosmoz.

